{"metadata":{"slug":[{"Plain":"终对象"},0],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"title":[{"Plain":"终对象"},2],"taxon":[{"Plain":"百科. "},3]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>观念</h2>\n<p>在范畴 $\\mathcal C$ 对象 $X$ 上的"},{"Local":{"url":"俯范畴","text":"俯范畴"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathcal C_{/X}$ (见"},{"Local":{"url":"相对","text":"相对观点"}},{"Plain":")中, 终对象就是 $X$ 自身.</p>\n"}]}}